# Apache Subversion
# website: https://subversion.apache.org
# docs: https://subversion.apache.org/docs/
# description: Apache Subversion (SVN) and TortoiseSVN working copy directories, conflict files, and administrative data

# Subversion administrative directories
.svn/
_svn/

# Subversion internal files and text-base
*.svn-base
*.svn-work
*.svn-revert

# Subversion conflict resolution files
*.mine
*.r[0-9]*